{%- comment -%}
PFC Areas - mirrors the Areas band of the web home page (`/`): two groups, the
life wheel and the household rooms, each with its rated date, a stale flag and
its rows worst first. Payload: `trmnl_home.areas_payload`.

E-ink rules: no emoji, no inline styles - framework classes only. The light is a
word (RED / YELLOW / GREEN), never a symbol; RED is filled, YELLOW outlined,
GREEN plain, so the rows that need attention stand out at a glance.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% template status_chip %}
{%- if status == "RED" -%}
<span class="label {{ size }} label--filled w--20 no-shrink">{{ status }}</span>
{%- elsif status == "YELLOW" -%}
<span class="label {{ size }} label--outline w--20 no-shrink">{{ status }}</span>
{%- else -%}
<span class="label {{ size }} w--20 no-shrink">{{ status }}</span>
{%- endif -%}
{% endtemplate %}
{% template group_head %}
<div class="flex flex--row flex--left gap--small">
  <span class="title {{ title_size }}">{{ group.label }}</span>
  <span class="label {{ size }}">{{ group.green }} of {{ group.rows.size }} GREEN</span>
</div>
{%- if group.stale -%}
<span class="label {{ size }} label--gray 1bit:text--black">{{ group.rated }} - stale, re-rate it</span>
{%- else -%}
<span class="label {{ size }} label--gray 1bit:text--black">{{ group.rated }}</span>
{%- endif -%}
{% endtemplate %}
